<title>ITALY: Italy's Bologna sees July CPI at 0.0 mo/mo.</title>
<headline>Italy's Bologna sees July CPI at 0.0 mo/mo.</headline>
<dateline>BOLOGNA, Italy 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian city of Bologna said its July consumer price index (CPI) stood at 0.0 percent month-on-month and x.x percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>In June, Bologna's CPI inflation rate was 0.0 percent and 1.7 percent repectively.</p>
<p>Bologna is one of 11 Italian cities to publish inflation data Monday and Tuesday. The city's CPI has a weighing of 7.62 percent on the national index. The 11 sample cities have a combined weighting of 75.66 percent on the total index.  </p>
<p>The following is the breakdown of the price changes.</p>
